OL,3,GNEWSATributes to woman, 18, killed in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old woman who died after a
OL,7,Ftraffic collision was a "beautiful
OL,8,Fhuman being, on the inside and the
OL,9,Foutside", her family has said.
OL,11,FEsme Heaton-Biggs was driving a white
OL,12,FVolkswagen Polo which collided with a
OL,13,Fwhite Mercedes on Bloxham Road in
OL,14,FBanbury, Oxfordshire on Saturday
OL,15,Fevening. She died later in hospital.
OL,17,FIn a tribute statement, her family
OL,18,Fsaid: "The world got suddenly dimmer as
OL,19,Fone of the brightest and most unique
OL,20,Flights left us too soon."
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
